Word tables (common.txt.gz, common-and-proper.txt.gz)

Derived from the en_US Hunspell dictionary (SCOWL size 60, version 2020.12.07, http://wordlist.sourceforge.net) as
packaged in the npm package dictionary-en@4.0.0 (license: MIT AND BSD; the full license is in LICENSE, copied unchanged).

common.txt.gz: every all-lowercase entry of index.dic, affix flags removed (base forms only), sorted.
common-and-proper.txt.gz: the entries the dictionary lists both as a proper noun (capitalized) and as a common word
("Grace" and "grace"), lowercased, sorted.
Rebuilt by api/src/scripts/buildWordTable.ts. Read by api/src/services/commonWords.ts.
